</italic> strain NGR234 encode host-specific nodulation of the tropical tree <italic>Leucaena leucocephala</italic></article-title><source>Molecular Plant-Microbe Interactions</source><year>1990</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>317</fpage><lpage>326</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2134856</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lodwig</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Poole</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metabolism of <italic>Rhizobium</italic> bacteroids</article-title><source>Critical Reviews in Plant Science</source><year>2003</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>37</fpage><lpage>78</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lopez-Lara</surname><given-names>IM</given-names></name><name><surname>Berg</surname><given-names>JDJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Thomas-Oates</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Glushka</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Lugtenberg</surname><given-names>BJJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Spaink</surname><given-names>HP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Structural identification of the lipo-chitin oligosaccharide nodulation signals of <italic>Rhizobium loti</italic></article-title><source>Molecular Microbiology</source><year>1995</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>627</fpage><lpage>638</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7783635</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mergaert</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Uchiumi</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Alunni</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Eukaryotic control on bacterial cell cycle and differentiation